@startuml dynamic-view

actor User
participant Camera
participant "React Client" as Client
participant "FastAPI Server" as Server
participant "Recognition Module" as Recognition
participant "Recognition Model" as Model
database Storage
participant Logs
participant "LED Indicator" as LED

== Frame capture ==
User -> Camera: Approaches camera
Camera -> Client: Capture frame (WebRTC)
Client -> Server: Send frame (WebSocket Base64)

== Face recognition ==
Server -> Recognition: Extract face embedding
Recognition -> Recognition: Detect face & check liveness
Recognition -> Model: Generate embedding
Model --> Recognition: Return embedding
Recognition --> Server: Return embedding & status

== Identity verification ==
Server -> Storage: Request identity match for embedding
Storage -> Storage: Fetch all stored embeddings
Storage -> Storage: Compare via Cosine Similarity
Storage --> Server: Return matching User ID

== Access decision ==
Server -> Server: Approve access

== Physical response and logging ==
Server -> Logs: Write successful access log
Server -> LED: Turn on blue LED
Server --> Client: Return Access Granted JSON
Client -> Client: Update UI (Green Box & Text)

@enduml